{"game":"Geoguessr","source":"custom","apworld":"geoguessr.apworld","world_version":"0.1.1","groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99},"doc_fr":"Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.\n\nUn réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.</p>\n<p>Un réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.</p>\n"},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full","doc_fr":"Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.\n\n**Full:** s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.\n\n**Minimal:** s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.</p>\n"},{"key":"victory_condition","name":"Victory Condition","kind":"choice","doc":"The condition that must be met to win the run. Available medals are: Bronze, Silver, Gold, Platinum (if enabled).\n\nMedals count: obtain a certain amount of medals (all types included)\nPlatinum count: obtain a certain amount of Platinum medals (perfect score)","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"medals_count","label":"Medals Count","id":0},{"value":"plat_count","label":"Plat Count","id":1}],"aliases":{},"default":"medals_count","doc_fr":"La condition qui doit être remplie pour gagner la course. Les médailles disponibles sont: Bronze, Argent, Or, Platine (si activé).\n\nMedals count: obtenir une certaine quantité de médailles (tous types compris)\nPlatinum count: obtenir une certaine quantité de médailles Platinum (score parfait)"},{"key":"medal_count","name":"Medal Count","kind":"range","doc":"The number of medals the player must collect to win the run.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":476,"default":20,"doc_fr":"Le nombre de médailles que le joueur doit gagner pour gagner la course."},{"key":"plat_count","name":"Platinum Medal Count","kind":"range","doc":"The number of platinum medals the player must collect to win the run.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":119,"default":5,"doc_fr":"Le nombre de médailles de platine que le joueur doit gagner pour gagner la course."},{"key":"accessible_countries_count","name":"Number of accessible countries","kind":"range","doc":"The number of randomly drawn country maps the player can unlock, on all continents combined.\n\nThere are 22 micro countries in the game, so be careful if you set the micro country limit to a lower value than 22: you will not be able to put the maximum amount of countries possible in this case.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":112,"default":10,"doc_fr":"Le nombre de cartes pays tirées au hasard que le joueur peut débloquer, sur tous les continents combinés.\n\nIl ya 22 micro pays dans le jeu, alors soyez prudent si vous fixez la limite de micro pays à une valeur inférieure à 22: vous ne serez pas en mesure de mettre le maximum de pays possibles dans ce cas."},{"key":"max_micro_countries_count","name":"Max number of micro-states or countries with minimal coverage","kind":"range","doc":"The maximum number of randomly drawn countries that can be micro-countries or countries with minimal coverage.\nThis option does not force the number of micro-countries, only limits them if they happen to be drawn too much.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":22,"default":3,"doc_fr":"Le nombre maximal de pays tirés au hasard qui peuvent être des micro-pays ou des pays ayant une couverture minimale.\nCette option ne force pas le nombre de micro-pays, elle ne les limite que s'ils sont trop attirés."},{"key":"countries_max_difficulty","name":"Countries max difficulty level","kind":"choice","doc":"A setting determining the maximum difficulty a drawn country can have.\n\nThis can restrict generation if the number of accessible countries parametered is too high to fill the game with enough countries of an acceptable difficulty.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"easy","label":"Easy","id":0},{"value":"medium","label":"Medium","id":1},{"value":"hard","label":"Hard","id":2}],"aliases":{},"default":"hard","doc_fr":"Un cadre déterminant la difficulté maximale qu'un pays attiré peut avoir.\n\nCela peut limiter la production si le nombre de pays accessibles est trop élevé pour remplir le jeu avec suffisamment de pays d'une difficulté acceptable."},{"key":"include_platinums","name":"include_platinums","kind":"toggle","doc":"A setting to allow the player to remove platinum medals locations","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true","doc_fr":"Un décor permettant au joueur de retirer les médailles de platine"},{"key":"custom_scaling_percentage","name":"Threshold scaling percentage for Bronze, Silver and Gold medals","kind":"range","doc":"A custom scaling percentage to be applied to thresholds. It will be applied to Bronze, Silver and Gold medal thresholds.\nDefault thresholds are Explorer mode values (Bronze 7500, Silver 15000, Gold 22500) but some countries are balanced to have a doable score.\nThis custom scaling is applied after that original balancing.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":50,"max":100,"default":100,"doc_fr":"Un pourcentage d'échelle sur mesure à appliquer aux seuils. Il sera appliqué aux seuils de médailles de bronze, d'argent et d'or.\nLes seuils par défaut sont les valeurs du mode Explorer (Bronze 7500, Silver 15000, Gold 22500), mais certains pays sont équilibrés pour avoir un score réalisable.\nCette échelle personnalisée est appliquée après cet équilibre original."}]},{"name":"Item & Location Options","collapsed":true,"options":[{"key":"local_items","name":"Local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be in their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be in their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"non_local_items","name":"Non-local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be outside their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be outside their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_inventory","name":"Start Inventory","kind":"counter","doc":"Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3} ","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}</p>\n","default":{},"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","min":null,"max":10000,"doc_fr":"Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}</p>\n"},{"key":"start_hints","name":"Start Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these item's locations prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these item's locations prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Commencez par les emplacements de ces éléments préremplis dans la commande ``!hint``.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par les emplacements de ces éléments préremplis dans la commande <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt>.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_location_hints","name":"Start Location Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Commencez avec ces emplacements et leur élément prérempli dans la commande ``!hint``.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez avec ces emplacements et leur élément prérempli dans la commande <tt class=\"docutils literal\"